<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_66f14f762d9ed93be7e45532f52e341584cfa69a96a4b48ae6ab5277a1a358e7_n0085/e_0030> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/MedicationEntity> .
